    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "`kickoffDevCronServer` is the development cron server module for the `kickoff` application."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Use this module for dev-scoped scheduled-job server activation, server configuration, and runtime topology. Cron capability behavior belongs in the relevant reusable modules."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Server configuration should remain environment-scoped, explicit, and safe to replace in QA, pre-production, and production."
    }
  ],
